      "description": "<p>Mod replace ammo for all bosses and their followers.</p>\n<p>Ammo selection order for each caliber:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Select ammo with penetration 40+</li>\n<li>If 0 founds. Select ammo with penetration 30+</li>\n<li>If 0 founds, Select 4 best ammo ordered by penetration power</li>\n</ol>\n<p>.45 ACP AP</p>\n<p>.366 TKM AP-M</p>\n<p>23x75mm Barrikada slug</p>\n<p>12/70 AP-20 armor-piercing slug</p>\n<p>12/70 flechette</p>\n<p>26x75mm flare cartridge (Red)</p>\n<p>26x75mm flare cartridge (Acid Green)</p>\n<p>26x75mm flare cartridge (White)</p>\n<p>26x75mm flare cartridge (Green)</p>\n<p>40x46mm M576 (MP-APERS) grenade</p>\n<p>40x46mm M406 (HE) grenade</p>\n<p>40x46mm M381 (HE) grenade</p>\n<p>40x46mm M441 (HE) grenade</p>\n<p>20/70 TSS Armor Piercing Slug</p>\n<p>20/70 Dangerous Game Slug</p>\n<p>20/70 flechette</p>\n<p>20/70 Poleva-6u slug</p>\n<p>12.7x108mm B-32</p>\n<p>12.7x108mm BZT-44M</p>\n<p>.300 Blackout AP</p>\n<p>.300 Blackout CBJ</p>\n<p>5.45x39mm PPBS gs Igolnik</p>\n<p>5.45x39mm BS gs</p>\n<p>5.45x39mm BP gs</p>\n<p>5.45x39mm 7N40</p>\n<p>.50 AE FMJ</p>\n<p>.50 AE Copper Solid</p>\n<p>7.62x25mm TT Pst gzh</p>\n<p>7.62x25mm TT PT gzh</p>\n<p>7.62x25mm TT P gl</p>\n<p>7.62x25mm TT AKBS</p>\n<p>40mm VOG-25 grenade</p>\n<p>4.6x30mm AP SX</p>\n<p>30x29mm VOG-30</p>\n<p>12.7x55mm PS12B</p>\n<p>20x1mm disk</p>\n<p>5.7x28mm SS190</p>\n<p>5.7x28mm L191</p>\n<p>9x19mm PBP gzh</p>\n<p>5.56x45mm SSA AP</p>\n<p>5.56x45mm M995</p>\n<p>5.56x45mm M855A1</p>\n<p>7.62x39mm MAI AP</p>\n<p>7.62x39mm BP gzh</p>\n<p>7.62x39mm PP gzh</p>\n<p>9x21mm 7N42 Zubilo</p>\n<p>9x21mm BT gzh</p>\n<p>MON-50 Shrapnel</p>\n<p>7.62x51mm M993</p>\n<p>7.62x51mm M80A1</p>\n<p>7.62x51mm M61</p>\n<p>7.62x51mm M80</p>\n<p>.357 Magnum FMJ</p>\n<p>7.62x54mm R BS gs</p>\n<p>7.62x54mm R SNB gzh</p>\n<p>7.62x54mm R BT gzh</p>\n<p>7.62x54mm R PS gzh</p>\n<p>.338 Lapua Magnum AP</p>\n<p>.338 Lapua Magnum FMJ</p>\n<p>6.8x51mm SIG Hybrid</p>\n<p>9x39mm BP gs</p>\n<p>9x39mm SP-6 gs</p>\n<p>9x39mm PAB-9 gs</p>\n<p>Optionally can be enabled for other bot types in config.json:</p>\n<p>{ “bloodhound” : false, “exusec” : false, “raider” : false, “sectant” : false }</p>\n",
